data: {"id": "6f79cbca92114ee8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1240", "run_id": "6f79cbca92114ee8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与证据分析\n\n### 1. Kubernetes Pod 状态 (kubectl_describe + kubectl_get_yaml)\n- **Pod 身份**: `aiops-case-v01/workload`, UID `6743bbac-552b-a35b-5f6327fe8a58`\n- **Phase**: Pending, nodeName: `<none>`, NodeScheduled condition: False, reason: Unschedulable\n- **资源需求**: Requests: cpu 未显式设置（但容器有 Limits cpu: 100m=0.1 core, memory: 8Mi）\n- **调度约束**: NodeSelectors: `<none>`, Tolerations: 仅 `node.kubernetes.io/not-ready:NoExecute`\n- **QoS Class**: Burstable\n\n### 2. 事件信息 (kubectl_events)\n- **FailedScheduling", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789105523824, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "6f79cbca92114ee8-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "6f79cbca92114ee8", "seq": 1241, "ts_ms": 1789105530266, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 35.567, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v01", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6f79cbca92114ee8-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "7d8ccc587e086887a92a3d8a1cfc0a88a532e59cb85e226bc65e23e3ac2fbbf1", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "704236ff33b6242254a51653679e84a6e2feda5b3e145b94b1a865f9e4d28195"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "6f79cbca92114ee8-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "6f79cbca92114ee8", "seq": 1242, "ts_ms": 1789105530267, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "6f79cbca92114ee8-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "6f79cbca92114ee8", "seq": 1243, "ts_ms": 1789105537348, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.081, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1307, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | 集群中全部3个节点的CPU资源不足（Insufficient cpu），导致调度器无法为Pod分配节点，且无可用资源进行预emption。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes (pod.condition) | 类型 `PodScheduled` 状态 `False`；原因 `Unschedulable`；消息 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod..` | 确认 Pod 无法被调度到 3 个节点，且未发生预emption |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes (container.resource_request.cpu) | 容器 `app` CPU 请求值 `100k` (0.1 core) | 确认调度器需要寻找具有至少 0.1 core 可用 CPU 的节点 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes (event.message) | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu.` (17m) | 验证集群整体 CPU 资源不足，确认调度失败现象 |\n\n*证据相互印证：K8s Event 和 Pod Condition 状态均一致指出 3 个节点均无法满足 CPU 调度需求，且无预emption 空间，证实集群层面资源枯竭。*\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n集群整体CPU资源枯竭 → 调度器无法满足Pod CPU请求 → FailedScheduling (Insufficient cpu) → Pod处于Pending状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是集群中全部 3 个节点的 CPU 资源不足（Insufficient cpu），导致调度器无法为 Pod `aiops-case-v01/workload` 分配节点。该现象已通过 `fact-6a6ded4202a4` (Pod 调度条件失败) 和 `fact-2fbce5fc60ee` / `fact-c1cf7056f22e` (FailedScheduling 事件) 证实。由于所有节点资源均无法满足 `100k` CPU 请求且无预emption 机制触发，Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | 集群中全部3个节点的CPU资源不足（Insufficient cpu），导致调度器无法为Pod分配节点，且无可用资源进行预emption。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes (pod.condition) | 类型 `PodScheduled` 状态 `False`；原因 `Unschedulable`；消息 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod..` | 确认 Pod 无法被调度到 3 个节点，且未发生预emption |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes (container.resource_request.cpu) | 容器 `app` CPU 请求值 `100k` (0.1 core) | 确认调度器需要寻找具有至少 0.1 core 可用 CPU 的节点 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes (event.message) | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu.` (17m) | 验证集群整体 CPU 资源不足，确认调度失败现象 |\n\n*证据相互印证：K8s Event 和 Pod Condition 状态均一致指出 3 个节点均无法满足 CPU 调度需求，且无预emption 空间，证实集群层面资源枯竭。*\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n集群整体CPU资源枯竭 → 调度器无法满足Pod CPU请求 → FailedScheduling (Insufficient cpu) → Pod处于Pending状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是集群中全部 3 个节点的 CPU 资源不足（Insufficient cpu），导致调度器无法为 Pod `aiops-case-v01/workload` 分配节点。该现象已通过 `fact-6a6ded4202a4` (Pod 调度条件失败) 和 `fact-2fbce5fc60ee` / `fact-c1cf7056f22e` (FailedScheduling 事件) 证实。由于所有节点资源均无法满足 `100k` CPU 请求且无预emption 机制触发，Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

